message: "If you use this research project, please cite the working paper."
title: "From ‘God’ to Infrastructure: The Self-Expanding Logic of Artificial Intelligence, Energy, and Space Industry"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Tan
    given-names: Scott
date-released: 2026-09-19
version: "1.0"
abstract: >-
  This paper develops a structural framework for examining how AI may become coupled
  to energy, computation, robotics, manufacturing, resource access, and space infrastructure.
  It proposes networked industrial self-expansion as an alternative to literal machine self-replication.
